        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I have been coming here for dry cleaning for over a year. The people are always great. Had one little issue and they corrected it perfectly. Thank you!",
        "time": 1762895081,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "nellie pilla",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100328169582441570248/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKJxNUAC7gO2wB2AUM1qqZC78AGyT6I1nzpUku7dJUvlWps4A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "They are certainly not bilingual, the man refused to speak English and I went 1 time and they ruined my article not even wanting to compensate me for it pretty expensive item and now I have to spend money to get it replaced. Beware with expensive items",
        "time": 1748711026,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nick Antonelli",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100103166936463959472/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ31Xkq3SNMplxPjFnbl78C3LYScZxCabdxFbrYN5fXoNDYpg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "I love this place! I've been going there for 3 years.  I bring my suits and shirts on a regular basis.  I'm there every week.  They always done everything perfectly. They were even able to fix one of my blazers that another dry cleaner had basically ruined.\nCustomer for life",
        "time": 1491388568,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Olivia",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103663585927860968848/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL1TPW6bmQwpB5zsesmxYPOj3_pwpvAKaQ-X37vt_1O9dRx4A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Had my carpet cleaned, I am very satisfied. The staff was friendly and kind. They have to send it out to be cleaned, but called me as soon as it was back which was actually quicker than expected! Very accommodating and kind.",
        "time": 1676056618,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Fred",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100564119508762778329/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdMdtH0gk5f11AQhyWmu_oZT8ONVzt3mk8Trc3QL-mjhMsviU0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "Horrible customer service does not care about their clientele - no refunds\n\nIf something happens to your clothes and becomes damaged they will not assume any responsability and they will not refund you. You can pay and leave with your destroyed things.\n\nIts a one way street - \"yes we broke your stuff but its not our fault and we wont refund you not even the cleaning charges\"\n\nDont waste your money or risk having a problem with them.\n\nWill never go back",
        "time": 1491086121,
        "translated": false
      }
